        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 89,
        "raw": "[name=\"Carol\"]   ...I'm fine, it's just a bruise. As you said, it's best that we keep moving...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Carol",
        "content": "...I'm fine, it's just a bruise. As you said, it's best that we keep moving..."
    },
    {
        "id": 90,
        "raw": "[name=\"Carol\"]   Once we cross this forest, we'll reach the foot of Mt. Mortica. We need to find the second cave halfway up the mountain.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Carol",
        "content": "Once we cross this forest, we'll reach the foot of Mt. Mortica. We need to find the second cave halfway up the mountain."
    },
    {
        "id": 91,
