        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 94,
        "raw": "[name=\"Carol\"]   Yeah. Once inside, we'll still have to follow some paths in the darkness, but I know the way. The treasure is hidden in the deepest part of the cave.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Carol",
        "content": "Yeah. Once inside, we'll still have to follow some paths in the darkness, but I know the way. The treasure is hidden in the deepest part of the cave."
